msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Slowly, she began to stroke, doing as the goblin asked of her."
msgstr "Медленно она начала ласкать его, делая то, о чём просил гоблин."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "It's grunts came out as sharp, pitched shrieks, as she quickened her pace."
