msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Completely naked, all of herself exposed."
msgstr "Она была совершенно нагая — всё её тело было открыто."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The crowd of men roared louder than they had done before."
msgstr "Толпа мужчин закричала громче, чем прежде."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She did not speak their language, but she did not need to in order to understand them."
msgstr "Она не говорила на их языке, но ей это и не было нужно, чтобы понять их."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The Old Tribesman still kept her in his grip."
msgstr "Старый соплеменник всё ещё держал её в своей хватке."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Twisting and pulling, he yanked her about, showing off all of her body as if she were livestock."
