msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "We're in here for little more than a week, and we're already losing our marbles."
msgstr "Мы здесь чуть больше недели, а мы уже теряем голову."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Hugh laughed."
