msgid "Sitting there, Sarah tried to process what had all happened."
msgstr "Сидя там, Сара пыталась осмыслить всё, что произошло."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Not even a day had gone by since she woke up in the alley, and now she was here..."
