msgid "Up on your feet, prisoner."
msgstr "На ноги, заключённая."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah did as she was ordered."
msgstr "Сара сделала то, что ей велели."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She saw him looking at her, surprised for a moment, as if he couldn't believe she was here."
