msgid "Samayra looked around the room as she began to slowly swim, almost float, through the water."
msgstr "Самайра оглядела комнату, медленно плавая в воде, почти как будто она парила."

msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Back in Bagrad the palace had a place like this too..."
msgstr "В Баграде во дворце тоже было такое место..."

msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "But whenever I had to take a bath, there would be servants around to help me."
