msgid "Sarah watched as Samayra turned her eyes lower, inward."
msgstr "Сара смотрела, как Самайра опустила глаза ниже, внутрь себя."

msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "The truth is, my father had made a lot of mistakes over the years."
