msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Still twisting her wrist, Sarah couldn't help but stumble onto the ground."
msgstr "Сара, продолжая скручивать его запястье, не смогла удержаться и упала на землю."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Before she even knew what had happened, she was on her back, looking up."
